281 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 120 0 R
/E (Standard stacking failed: base learners are 99.8% right on ordinary out-of-fold rows, so the meta-learner copied them and ignored the anomaly score \(weight 0.98\). We build the meta-set twice, once with stratified folds and once with every attack type held out in exactly one fold. Now the combiner sees the trees being confidently wrong while the anomaly signal is high, and learns to defer to it \(weight 5.3\).)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
