/P 124 0 R
/E (Novelty-aware stacking is the main contribution: holding out whole attack types when building the meta-set teaches the combiner when to trust the anomaly signal. The subspace profile adds a second step. Limitations are measured, not hidden: 38.7% false alarms on KDDTest-21 and weak calibration below a 5% false-alarm budget.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [5]
>>
